            %p
              This entry is about
              %em partition functions
              in the sense of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/statistical+mechanics"} statistical mechanics
              and
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+field+theory"} quantum field theory
              = succeed "/" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/number+theory"} number theory
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/combinatorics"} combinatorics
              that assigns to a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/natural+number"} natural number
              the number of its
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/partitions"} partitions
              see at
              = succeed "." do
